{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Large Logs are fallen trees found on ",["l","农场","the Farm"],". A single large log is found in ",["l","煤矿森林","Cindersap Forest"]," (blocking the entrance to the ",["l","秘密森林","Secret Woods"],"). Another large log is found blocking a ",["l","小巷自助餐","secret passage"]," to the east between the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith"]," and ",["l","Joja超市","JojaMart"],". Large Logs can also be found on floors 41-69 of ",["l","矿井","the Dangerous Mines"],". A ",["l","斧头","Steel Axe"]," (or better quality) is required to remove a large log, yielding 8 ",["l","硬木","Hardwood"]," (10 with the ",["l","技能","Forester"]," profession) and 25 ",["l","采集","Foraging"]," Experience points. Large Logs will never reappear once removed."]],["g",[["Secretwoods_entrance.png",320,["Entrance to the ",["l","秘密森林","Secret Woods"]," location with the log blocking it."]]]]]],["Trivia",2,[["p",["Destroying a large log takes:"]],["l",0,[[1,["9 hits with a Steel Axe"]],[1,["7 hits with a Gold Axe"]],[1,["6 hits with an Iridium Axe"]],[1,["5 hits with a ",["l","锻造","Powerful"]," Gold Axe"]],[1,["3 hits with a ",["l","锻造","Powerful"]," Iridium Axe"]]]]]]],"f":[["Source",[["l","农场","The Farm"]," • Entrance to ",["l","秘密森林","Secret Woods"]," • ",["l","矿井","The Dangerous Mines"]]],["Season",["All"]]]}